---
/**
 * SkipLink
 *
 * The first focusable element in the document. Hidden until focused, then
 * pinned top-left above everything. Targets #main, which has tabindex="-1"
 * so focus actually lands there. Its padding and 44px height are set on
 * focus, because not-sr-only resets padding to 0. See docs/03-components.md
 * §2.5.
 *
 * @example
 * <SkipLink />
 */
---

<a
  href="#main"
  class="sr-only z-skip-link rounded-xs bg-surface text-body-sm text-link shadow-card-hover focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-2 focus:left-2 focus:flex focus:min-h-touch focus:items-center focus:px-4"
>
  Skip to content
</a>
